  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large earthenware bowl over medium heat.",
    "add the minced garlic and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "add the chopped rosemary and cook for 1 minute more.",
    "add the sliced zucchini, yellow bell pepper, and red onion, and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the chopped parsley, kalamata olives, capers, lemon juice, honey, cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "dust the inside of the bowl with flour, then carefully add the vegetable mixture and flambe with a match or lighter, if desired.",
    "serve the silky, flavorful oil sauce over the vegetables and enjoy!",
    "garnish with additional parsley, if desired.",
    "serve immediately, as the sauce will thicken and lose its silky texture over time."
